flowchart TD
  Start([CI Report erzeugt]) --> GIn{Eingang?}
  GIn -->|manuell| Man[importCicdReport]
  GIn -->|Watch| Watch[startCiWatch]
  Man --> Val[JSON Schema validieren]
  Watch --> Val
  Val --> GVal{Valid?}
  GVal -->|ok| Map[TreeViews mappen]
  Map --> Triage[Triage Rules]
  Triage --> Ok([Findings sichtbar])
  GVal -->|invalid| Rej[Audit + Notification]
  Rej --> Fail([Import abgebrochen])
